Package: cogzoo
Title: A Community Zoo of Computational Cognitive Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("George", "Kachergis", email = "george.kachergis@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A curated, community-contributed collection of computational
    models of cognition (memory, categorization, learning, decision-making,
    and beyond) sharing a common simulate/fit/predict interface, bundled
    reference datasets with validated metadata, and reproducibility tests
    for every model-dataset pairing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    graphics,
    stats,
    utils,
    yaml
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    RWiener,
    rtdists,
    catlearn
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/kachergis/cogzoo
BugReports: https://github.com/kachergis/cogzoo/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
